      Feng, Sheng Wu, Mengqi Yang, Xuyan Chen, Yefeng Zheng, Rui Jiang, Ting Chen. 
      Originally published in the Journal of Medical Internet Research 
      (https://www.jmir.org), 23.08.2024.
